      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "In patients with ischemic heart disease with various degree of severity of atherosclerotic involvement of peripheral arteries maintenance of target levels of arterial pressure and heart rate with the help of therapy which includes cardioselective -adrenoblocker as a preparation of choice with addition if necessary of a calcium antagonist and angiotensin converting enzyme inhibitor allows to successfully control myocardial ischemia and heart rate under conditions of everyday life."},
